Kafka it is open source distributed event steaming platform
	collects all the events and sends to multiple service

Key components of kafka

PRODUCER: sends data
CONSUMER: recieve data
BROKER: Kafka brokers are servers that store data and serve client requests.
		multiple brokers are there
		replicas are made
		
TOPIC: it is basically ka data,(payment)
PARTITION: which divide large data in to partitions
zookeeper: it is like a coordinator for syncronization & configuration
kraft: kraft is in built now managing things

kafka connect- it is framework for integrating kafka with external system like Databases,filesystem
kakfa streams - Kafka Streams is a library which process the livedata in realtime. 

